<title>POLAND: Drosed Q3 net rises to PLN 3.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Drosed Q3 net rises to PLN 3.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drosed SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q3 1996     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				3.81   vs    2.30</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  3.78   vs    3.23</p>
<p>    net					3.20   vs    2.43</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Drosed Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     42.56   vs   25.86</p>
<p>    costs of sales			34.55   vs   20.32</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.58   vs    0.80</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.68   vs    1.36</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.71   vs    0.43</p>
<p>    investment			     0.58   vs    0.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating				6.48   vs    5.53</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  5.88   vs    6.46</p>
<p>    net					4.17   vs    4.81</p>
<p>    net sales			    101.17   vs   67.79</p>
<p>    costs of sales			82.16   vs   54.57</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.71   vs    1.65</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.78   vs    3.22</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.39   vs    2.29</p>
<p>    investment				 na   vs	na</p>
